  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1742760661_1782569_54ac3605ba345a3fb38a48417b2bfd02.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"193\" data-start=\"84\">Brand Introduction:<br><br></strong>Pixels are the first-ever Bluetooth-connected, customizable polyhedral dice&mdash;built for real tabletop play.&nbsp;We launched as the #1 dice project in Kickstarter history, raising $3.5M, and are still fulfilling backer rewards across 45 unique dice. Public availability just kicked off with limited D20s in 3 colors. It&rsquo;s the perfect time to get involved&mdash;this is only the beginning.&nbsp;</span><br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point</strong>s):<br><br></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"138\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"140\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"140\">Tabletop-First Design</strong></span><br data-end=\"168\" data-start=\"165\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Premium resin dice, no programming required out of the box&mdash;just roll.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"329\" data-start=\"226\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"329\" data-start=\"228\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"228\">Deep Customization</strong></span><br data-end=\"253\" data-start=\"250\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Set colors, lights, and sounds per face. 40% bought for this reason alone.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"329\" data-start=\"226\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>Long Battery Life with Wireless Charging</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Many players report months of use before needing to recharge.</span></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"428\" data-start=\"331\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"428\" data-start=\"333\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"359\" data-start=\"333\">In-App Roll Assistance</strong></span><br data-end=\"362\" data-start=\"359\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Quick roll formulas, modifiers, and tracking. Easy and evolving.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"538\" data-start=\"430\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"538\" data-start=\"432\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"467\" data-start=\"432\">Optional Bluetooth Connectivity</strong></span><br data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"467\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Connect to Foundry, D&amp;D Beyond, Roll20 &amp; more&mdash;only if you want to.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"540\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"636\" data-start=\"542\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"568\" data-start=\"542\">Accessibility Built-In</strong></span><br data-end=\"571\" data-start=\"568\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Hear rolls aloud, adjust LED contrast, and contribute feedback. Great for players with visual impairment!&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"638\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"640\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"640\">Community-Driven</strong></span><br data-end=\"663\" data-start=\"660\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Shaped by players, not just engineers, Pixels are open-source so tech-savvy folks can connect them to anything!</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"805\" data-start=\"705\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"805\" data-start=\"707\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"732\" data-start=\"707\">In-Person is the Core</strong></span><br data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"732\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">70% would&rsquo;ve bought without online play. Customization is the heart.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"807\" style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"809\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"809\">Shipping in Progress</strong></span><br data-end=\"836\" data-start=\"833\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Pixels raised $3.5M on Kickstarter in 2021 and is still fulfilling backer rewards for 45 dice variations (9 types x 5 colorways). That's why only 3 colors of D20s are available right now. If a backer asks, feel free to let them know: all Kickstarter and pre-order customers get monthly updates via Kickstarter and our blog, and shipping is happening in waves as production completes. More is on the way!</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
